{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">美伊戰事持續，原油期貨價格繼續上升。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">紐約期油收市報83.23美元一桶，升74美仙，升幅百分之0.9。倫敦期油收市報89.22美元一桶，升1.12美元，升幅近百分之1.3。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-21T00:39:52.560777+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":86,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}